   "message": "Add Arcade + per-phase games, dual/combined leaderboards, owner-only governance\n\nGame layer (no build step, native ES modules):\n- engine/ — seeded RNG (shared browser+Node), RAF loop, pointer drag, GameHost\n- Arcade hub (#/arcade) with two flagship games: Substitution (drag-to-solve\n  cryptogram) and Hash Miner (idle, offline progress)\n- Replay-verified arcade leaderboard: games/sim/* are pure logic imported by both\n  the browser and .github/scripts/verify-arcade.mjs, so scores are recomputed from\n  the move-log, not trusted (workflow + issue template + data/arcade-*)\n- Per-phase games (games/phasegames.js): every door playable via a data-driven\n  `play` field — assemble (P1 lyric, P2/P3 password→decrypts real next blob, P3.2\n  confession, SalPhaseIon chunks) and spiral (P0 genesis grid); Cosmic runs the\n  REAL crypto and logs a frontier attempt. Solving cracks the door + awards XP.\n- Combined \"Overall champions\" board merges the Hive + Arcade by handle, both\n  detailed boards kept separate (leaderboards.js)\n- root package.json {type:module} so Node imports the shared .js sims as ESM\n\nGovernance — maintainer-only control:\n- CODEOWNERS + protect-paths.yml (hard PR guard) + docs/GOVERNANCE.md lock\n  data/**, .github/**, content/config.js to @HosterjackAGV\n- Untrack + gitignore all Claude files (CLAUDE.md stays local, never pushed)\n\nVerified: all modules node --check clean; sim + per-phase functional tests pass\n(assembled passwords decrypt the real phase3/phase32 blobs).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
